OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after cat tail 'posted'
OL,4,Athrough letterbox
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation is under way after a
OL,7,Fcat's tail was apparently posted
OL,8,Fthrough a letterbox.
OL,10,FHumberside Police said the incident is
OL,11,Freported to have happened in Appleton
OL,12,FRoad, Hull, on 18 September.
OL,14,FA 37-year-old woman and two men, aged
OL,15,F47 and 75, were all arrested on
OL,16,Fsuspicion of malicious communications
OL,17,Fand failing to prevent the causing of
OL,18,Funnecessary suffering to an animal.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
