OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after cat tail 'posted'
OL,4,Athrough letterbox
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe younger man was also arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of assault and criminal
OL,8,Fdamage, and the older man on suspicion
OL,9,Fof witness intimidation and harassment.
OL,10,FAll three remain in police custody.
